{"id":18596298095,"name":"Linglox","desc":"PLAYING LINGO BEFORE PLAYING THIS IS RECOMMENDED HEAVILY\nFind it just by searching lingothegame. The first result is the official website!\n\nLinglox, you're set in a large world, able to roam around and solve all of the word puzzle objects called \"Prompts\". You're capable of finding alternative answers to Prompts throughout your gameplay, be careful! With over 10000+ Prompts to solve and 100+ Prompt colors, you're going to climb your way up to the title of a mastermind.\n\nTo solve a Prompt, type in the correct answer! The color and height of the block matter. \n\nInspired by: Brenton Wildes' \"Lingo I & II\" and Arvi Teikari's \"Baba Is You\"\n\nCreated by: Many People...\nArtwork credits: Moon, Croutons and Ange for badge icons and loading screens, they're awesome, go check them out (@._moon_moon_.), (@croutons0292), (@cosmoshining)! \nCheck the art gallery for the community's art!","path":"/game/18596298095-linglox","slug":"18596298095-linglox","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/35c62c5534e83eaf5869f6f5492612dbd265164e6476b16c8b49166892a5bcd5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-74b107034afaa24d7d93cb932c859bc6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":86,"visitor":1472375,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-17T16:31:09.428Z","creator":{"name":"Bem10ISAQUE_2's group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a5a58cd4c0da3940c44630d","title":"OP Auto Solver | Hub","game":{"_id":"6a5a58cd4c0da3940c44630c","gameId":18596298095,"name":"Linglox","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/35c62c5534e83eaf5869f6f5492612dbd265164e6476b16c8b49166892a5bcd5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-74b107034afaa24d7d93cb932c859bc6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"18596298095-linglox","path":"/game/18596298095-linglox","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/35c62c5534e83eaf5869f6f5492612dbd265